msgid "Partly supported"
msgstr "Compatibilidad parcial"

#: src/luna/mod.rs:361
msgid ""
"This build needs TIDAL's own Last.fm key, which Tidalfast does not have."
msgstr ""
"Esta versión necesita la clave de Last.fm propia de TIDAL, que Tidalfast no "
"tiene."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:365
msgid ""
"It saves TIDAL songs as files, which Tidalfast does not allow (use Download "
"in Tidalfast to listen offline)."
msgstr ""
"Guarda canciones de TIDAL como archivos, algo que Tidalfast no permite (usa "
"Descargar en Tidalfast para escuchar sin conexión)."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:369
msgid ""
"It needs TIDAL's own remote control code, which Tidalfast does not have."
msgstr ""
"Necesita el código de control remoto propio de TIDAL, que Tidalfast no tiene."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:373
msgid ""
"It sends your TIDAL sign-in to the author's server, which Tidalfast never "
"allows, so its remote control cannot run."
msgstr ""
"Envía tu inicio de sesión de TIDAL al servidor del autor, algo que Tidalfast "
"nunca permite, así que su control remoto no puede funcionar."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:377
msgid ""
"Its mini player is a separate browser window, which Tidalfast does not "
"include."
msgstr ""
"Su minirreproductor es una ventana de navegador independiente, que Tidalfast "
"no incluye."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:381
msgid ""
"It needs to listen for media keys across the whole computer, which Tidalfast "
"does not allow (Tidalfast has its own media controls)."
msgstr ""
"Necesita escuchar las teclas multimedia en todo el ordenador, algo que "
"Tidalfast no permite (Tidalfast tiene sus propios controles multimedia)."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:385
msgid ""
"It plays through the mpv program and talks to it over a channel Tidalfast "
"does not allow."
msgstr ""
"Reproduce mediante el programa mpv y se comunica con él por un canal que "
"Tidalfast no permite."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:389
msgid ""
"It marks playlists inside TIDAL's web \"add to playlist\" window, which "
"Tidalfast does not have."
msgstr ""
"Marca las playlists dentro de la ventana web «Añadir a una playlist» de "
"TIDAL, que Tidalfast no tiene."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:393
msgid ""
"It needs a native add-on that Tidalfast cannot load (Tidalfast has its own "
"media controls)."
msgstr ""
"Necesita un complemento nativo que Tidalfast no puede cargar (Tidalfast "
"tiene sus propios controles multimedia)."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:397
msgid ""
"Last.fm scrobbling needs TIDAL's own Last.fm key, which Tidalfast does not "
"have."
msgstr ""
"El scrobbling de Last.fm necesita la clave de Last.fm propia de TIDAL, que "
"Tidalfast no tiene."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:401
msgid ""
"The lyrics bubble over the player bar works, but its separate lyrics window "
"does not, because that needs a browser engine."
msgstr ""
"La burbuja de letras sobre la barra del reproductor funciona, pero su "
"ventana de letras independiente no, porque necesita un motor de navegador."

